B.YZ=new A.an("feature_hexer","Hexer","[Action] Make a Ranged Attack vs Wis against 1 enemy range {1+Source}. On Success, deal {Source d10} damage and the target is hexed until the end of your next turn. While hexed, you and your allies have advantage on Status Checks against the target.\n\n[Reaction] When you succeed on an attack or an ally fails on an attack during their turn, spend your reaction and all the targets are hexed until the triggering characters next turn. If one of the targets is already hexed, you may end the hex for them to give all the other targets hex without spending your reaction. If your source has costs or effects when using abilities they trigger as normal.",B.L,B.a7o,!1)
B.Ty=new A.t("feature_hunter_practiced","Practiced","After using the action, gain {Half Source} rerolls. While concentrating, when you miss with an attack against the target of your Hunt, you may spend 1 reroll to reroll 1 attack dice.")
