B.aaP=s([B.TN,B.VL],t.U)
B.Zt=new A.an("feature_parry","Parry","Parry [Reaction] If an enemy range 1 would attack you, You may spend your reaction to make an Attack roll. On Success, Deal {Source d10} damage and the Enemy attack misses. On a miss, the attack succeeds against you. You may use a weapon instead targeting within the weapons reach, and dealing the weapon\u2019s damage ignoring the weapon\u2019s technique.\n\nPrepare [Action] Until the start of your next turn, you may parry {source} times without spending your reaction.",B.L,B.aaP,!1)
B.VY=new A.t("feature_pin_Executioner","Executioner","When allies hit your pin target, they deal {Half Source d6} extra damage.")
B.Xy=new A.t("feature_pin_Guard_Master","Guard Master","At the end of a grappled enemies adjacent to you turn, instead of them moving in the grapple, you may move them in the grapple instead. ")
