B.a6s=s([B.VY,B.Xy,B.T_],t.U)
B.Y5=new A.an("feature_pin","Pin","Pin [Action, 2 Unarmed] Make a Melee Attack vs Str targeting an enemy within 1. On Success, deal {Source d6} and you grapple the target and have pinning as long as you remain grappling. While Pinning, enemies adjacent to you grant your allies advantage when making Attacks from outside the grapple against the target rather than disadvantage. If they roll 2 failures they attack you instead. \n\n[Reaction] When an enemy starts its turn adjacent to you or becomes adjacent, Spend your reaction and make a Melee Attack vs Str. On Success, deal {Source d6} damage and grapple the target and gain pinning as long as you remain grappling.",B.L,B.a6s,!1)
B.Tb=new A.t("feature_poppet_Eyes","Eyes","While concentrating, During your turn you may spend your [Reaction] until the start of your next turn, the target has disadvantage on ranged attacks and defense checks caused by attacks from non adjacent attackers.")
B.UN=new A.t("feature_poppet_Heart","Heart","While concentrating, During your turn you may spend your [Reaction] deal {Half Source d6} damage ignoring shield and resistance. ")
B.VZ=new A.t("feature_poppet_Junk","Junk","While concentrating, During your turn you may spend your [Reaction] the target must make a concentration check with disadvantage if concentrating. Until the start of your next turn, reduce the target's speed by {Source} to no less than 1.")
B.a9w=s([B.Tb,B.UN,B.VZ],t.U)
B.Zq=new A.an("feature_poppet","Poppet","[Action] Make a Melee Attack vs Cha targeting 1 enemy range 1. On Success, deal {Source d8} damage and you make a poppet of the target that lasts as long as you remain concentrating. While concentrating, you and your allies have a +1 to attack results against the target and +1 to defense results caused by the target. The poppet requires a hand to wield.\n\n[Reaction] When you or an ally succeeds with a melee attack during their turn and has a free hand, spend your reaction and create a poppet for 1 of the targets. If an ally is the triggering character, you still concentrate on the poppet even when they are holding it.",B.L,B.a9w,!1)
