B.UC=new A.t("feature_puppet_BodyGuard","BodyGuard","[Reaction] When an attack would target you, you may spend your reaction to teleport your puppet to a free space adjacent to you and it becomes the target of the attack instead.")
B.TH=new A.t("feature_puppet_Distant_Strings","Distant Strings","The attack becomes Ranged with a range becomes {2*Source} /{4*Source}. If you Succeed on an attack at the long range, you have advantage on your first {Source} Status Checks vs the Target.")
B.aaB=s([B.V5,B.UC,B.TH],t.U)
B.YQ=new A.an("feature_puppet","Puppet","[Action] Melee Attack vs Int targeting 1 enemy range {Source}, On Success: The target is your puppet as long as you remain concentrating. On the Start of Its Turn, Make an Status Check Vs Int, On Success: You may have the target move up to its speed and use a single Innate Action, [Chump Action], or Skill in combat action against a target of your choice. On a Miss: The target is stunned and the effect ends.\n\n[Reaction] When you or an ally Succeeds on an Attack during their turn, Spend your reaction and make a Status Check vs Int, On Success the target becomes your puppet for as long as you remain concentrating.",B.L,B.aaB,!1)
B.Xe=new A.t("feature_rain_Ice_Storm","Ice Storm","On Success, Give targeted enemies {Source /3} cold. While Concentrating, At the start of your Turn, Make an Status Check vs Wis, On Success, enemies in the area gain {Source /3} cold.")
B.Va=new A.t("feature_rain_Wandering_Storm","Wandering Storm","While Concentrating, At the Start of the Round, you may move your rain area {Source} Spaces.")
B.X3=new A.t("feature_rain_Soothing_Rain","Soothing Rain","when an ally ends their turn in the area they gain {Source d6} shield. This includes the bonus to gaining shields in the area.")
B.a9I=s([B.Xe,B.Va,B.X3],t.U)
B.YJ=new A.an("feature_rain","Rain","[Action] Make a Ranged Attack vs Wis, targeting enemies in a 1 space radius range 6. On Success, they take {Source d8} Damage. Regardless, the area remains under a rain cloud as long as you remain concentrating. Whenever an enemy in the area is attacked, they take an extra {half Source d6} damage. Whenever an ally in the area gains shield or heals, increase the amount by {Half Source d6}.\n\n[Reaction] When you or an ally succeeds on an Attack during their turn, spend your reaction and place a 1 space radius rain cloud so that at least 1 of the spaces of a target of the triggering attack is in the radius that lasts as long as you remain concentrating. Apply the bonus damage to the triggering attack.",B.L,B.a9I,!1)
