B.YM=new A.an("feature_rally","Rally","[Action] make a status check, on success, target all allies range 4 and heal them {Source d6} and they gain +1 to the results of either attacks or defenses until the start of your next turn. Pick which bonus each time you use the ability.\n\n[Reaction] After an Ally takes damage from an attack, Spend your reaction and make a status check, On Success, target the triggering ally and all allies range 4 and heal them {Source d6} and they gain +1 to the results of either attacks or defenses until the start of your next turn. Pick which bonus each time you use the ability.",B.ay,B.a8L,!1)
B.Si=new A.t("feature_rot_Festering","Festering","When Rot prevents Healing or Shield the target takes Damage equal to what they would have gained.")
