B.Uc=new A.t("feature_rupture_BloodWalker","BloodWalker","Once during your turn, when adjacent to a Creature with Bleed you may teleport to a space adjacent to a creature with Bleed.")
B.a7P=s([B.WB,B.Uf,B.Uc],t.U)
B.YI=new A.an("feature_rupture","Rupture","[Action] Make a Melee Attack vs Vit targeting an enemy range 1. On Success, give the target {Source} d6 Rupture Bleed. As long as they have Rupture Bleed, before rolling the bleed, if they moved or dashed more than 1 space this turn, increase the dice size of the bleed by 2 to a max of d12. \n\n[Reaction] When you Succeed on an Attack, Spend your reaction and give all the targets of the triggering attack, {Source} d6 Rupture Bleed.",B.L,B.a7P,!1)
B.Ue=new A.t("feature_sanctuary_Sleepy","Sleepy","When allies gain rest, If they are prone or choose to drop prone, they gain both benefits. When an ally in the sanctuary benefits from the extra healing or shield, they may drop prone to gain {Source d6} extra instead.")
B.Wl=new A.t("feature_sanctuary_Guardian","Guardian","[Reaction] When an enemy starts its turn in your sanctuary or enters for the first time, Make a Melee Attack vs Wis. On Success, Deal {Source d6} damage and the target is restrained until the end of its turn. Regardless, dash to a free space adjacent to the target.")
B.TM=new A.t("feature_sanctuary_Orchard","Orchard","Your allies may spend their [Reaction] During their turn when they are in the sanctuary and there are no adjacent enemies to heal {Half Source d6} and gain {Half Source d6} shield. Note: this doesn\u2019t trigger sanctuary.")
B.Ub=new A.t("feature_sanctuary_Hallowed","Hallowed","All Creatures in the sanctuary have +1 to defense results. Whenever a creature in the sanctuary deals damage, they take {Source/3 d6} damage. If you have Guardian, you do not have to make concentration checks because of this damage.")
B.a8O=s([B.Ue,B.Wl,B.TM,B.Ub],t.U)
B.XS=new A.an("feature_sanctuary","Sanctuary","Sanctuary [Action] Create a sanctuary that is a {Source} radius area containing at least 1 of your spaces for as long as you remain concentrating. While concentrating, when an ally in the sanctuary is healed or given shield by an ability other than this ability, they gain {Half Source d6} extra healing or shield. If an effect grants both, they choose either a bonus to healing or shield. Healing from regenerating in the area also gains this bonus healing. If an ability has multiple healing or shielding effects, only grant the bonus once per target.\n\nRest [Reaction] During your or ally turns, Spend your reaction and make a Status Check. On Success you and all your allies in the Sanctuary may either Heal {Half Source d6} or gain {Half Source d6} shield, decided by each character. If they do not have an enemy adjacent to them, they gain {Source d6} instead.\n",B.ay,B.a8O,!1)
B.Vm=new A.t("feature_size_change_Apex","Apex","Grow: Gain +1 Range, when you target creatures smaller than you, gain a +1 to attack and check results. Shrink: gain a +1 to defenses caused by creatures larger than you and you don't provoke attacks.")
B.S7=new A.t("feature_size_change_everchanging_size","EverChanging Size","If you have Grow, gain Shrink. If you have Shrink, gain Grow. At the start of your turn you may switch between shrink or grow.")
B.Ua=new A.t("feature_size_change_gift_of_change","Gift of Change","You may target an ally within 3 instead. You may not give the target a size perk they already have.")
B.a97=s([B.Vm,B.S7,B.Ua],t.U)
B.XV=new A.an("feature_size_change","Size Change","Shrink/Grow [Reaction] During your turn spend your reaction. For as long as you are concentrating, Grow or Shrink in size. While Growing, increase your size by 1 and pick a size perk for the new size you have gained. If you were already large, gain another large perk. While Shrinking, decrease your size by 1 and pick a size perk for your new size. If you were already small, pick another small perk. Use {source} instead of level in any calculations.",B.ay,B.a97,!1)
B.To=new A.t("feature_shadow_dancer_Lead_your_Partner","Lead Your Partner","When you shadow dance, You may bring 1 adjacent ally with you and teleport them to an unoccupied square adjacent to your new location. They may not be teleported above another creature. The Ally gains Shadow\u2019s Edge & Shadow\u2019s Grace if Available.")
B.Sx=new A.t("feature_shadow_dancer_Shadow_Edge","Shadow\u2019s Edge","After you use Shadow Dance, Your next Attack deals an extra {Half Source d8} Damage.")
B.RL=new A.t("feature_shadow_dancer_Shadow_Grace","Shadow\u2019s Grace","After you use Shadow Dance, Gain {Source} speed and your movement doesn\u2019t provoke attacks of opportunity until the end of your next turn.")
B.a9P=s([B.To,B.Sx,B.RL],t.U)
B.Yd=new A.an("feature_shadow_dancer","Shadow Dancer","Shadow Dance [Reaction] During your turn, If you are within 1 space of a creature, spend your reaction and you may teleport up to {2* Source}, to a Free Space adjacent to a creature. You may not teleport above a creature.\n\n[Reaction] End of any Turn if there is a character within 1 of you, spend your reaction and teleport up to {2* Source} to a free space adjacent to a creature. You may not Teleport above a creature.\n",B.ay,B.a9P,!1)
B.Sk=new A.t("feature_snuff_out_area","Area","On success, deal the damage and extra burn damage to all enemies range {Half Source} of the target.")
B.WA=new A.t("feature_snuff_out_ember","Ember","On Success, Until the end of your next turn, the first time the target would gain Burn, They gain {Half Source} extra d6 Burn vs Dex. ")
B.W3=new A.t("feature_snuff_out_smoke","Smoke","On Success, until the start of the targets turn, the target and enemies within {Source} of the target have a -1 to attack results.")
B.SO=new A.t("feature_snuff_out_murderous_glee","Murderous Glee","Whenever you kill a target with snuff out, gain {Source d12} shield, and dash to a free space within {Source}. Until the end of your next turn or for as long as you concentrate, you and your allies have advantage on attacks against targets within {Source} spaces of you.")
B.a9T=s([B.Sk,B.WA,B.W3,B.SO],t.U)
B.XI=new A.an("feature_snuff_out","Snuff Out","[Action] make a melee attack vs Dex targeting 1 enemy range 5 with burn. On Success, deal {Source d8}, and have the target roll and take their burn damage then end their burn. \n\n[Reaction] When an enemy range 3 rolls burn dice, Spend your Reaction and the target rolls their burn again and also takes {Half Source d6}, Then end the burn.",B.L,B.a9T,!1)
B.U8=new A.t("feature_slap_duel","Duel","On success, pick one of the targets, until the start of your next turn, the target has disadvantage on attacks that don't include you as a target and you have disadvantage on attacks that don\u2019t include the target as a target.")
B.Wz=new A.t("feature_slap_how_dare_you","How Dare You","On Success, Until the end of your next turn, after the target attacks you, deal {Half Source d6} damage to the enemy regardless of success.")
B.U0=new A.t("feature_slap_shame","Shame","On Success, You and your allies gain a +1 to on defense results from the target's attacks until the start of your next turn. ")
B.a8M=s([B.U8,B.Wz,B.U0],t.U)
B.YD=new A.an("feature_slap","Slap","[Action] Make a Melee Attack Vs Vit targeting each enemy within 1. On Success, deal {Source d12} damage and the targets may not make attacks of opportunity until the start of your next turn. \n\n[Reaction] Before an enemy range 1 makes an opportunity attack, make a Melee Attack vs Vit. On success, deal {Source d12} damage and the opportunity attack misses.",B.L,B.a8M,!1)
B.XC=new A.t("feature_sleep_dream_thief","Dream Thief","On succeeding the status check, Gain {Source d6} shields and the target loses the same amount of shield if they have any. If they have no shield, you may have them take damage instead, ending the effect.")
B.UW=new A.t("feature_sleep_dream_walker","Dream Walker","Once during your turn, you may teleport to a space adjacent to a sleeping character. When you and your allies move, they may teleport from a space adjacent to a sleeping target to another space adjacent to a sleeping target.")
B.X9=new A.t("feature_sleep_exhaustion","Exhaustion","When the effect ends, the target\u2019s speed is reduced by {Half Source} until the end of their turn. ")
