B.Pu=new A.bM("ranged_suppressor","Suppressor","On Player Failure, on the target's next turn, half their speed and they cannot retreat. On player success, they are slowed by 1 and cannot retreat.",B.du,B.cZ)
B.OM=new A.bM("ranged_disabler","Disabler","On Player Failure, the target is disabled during their next turn.\n[Reaction] When a player ends their turn in range 6, Make the Disabler attack.",B.du,B.cZ)
